{
  "assessment": {
    "assessor": "primary agent under ADR 0026; bounded property assessment, no case admission",
    "attribution": "The launcher is new in the selected commit and implements a requirement already present in its parent. There is no base launcher to execute; the parent requirement and new original file establish the change boundary.",
    "base": "170fdf488df959ac503d5d419924caf5fec7bd8a",
    "case_admitted": false,
    "commit": "51a7698535f065604337f5c1d54f20267e8be2a0",
    "control_scope": "These checks support environment preparation, argument preservation and failure propagation for the original 18-line launcher. The recorder is the downstream process endpoint, not a reviewer or implementation of the supervisor.",
    "disposition": "named-launch-properties-preserved",
    "observations": [
      "The two shell files export their assigned synthetic values to the dispatched process; a missing file preserves the inherited synthetic value.",
      "The npm tool directory precedes the fallback path and selects the recorder there. PYTHONPATH names the original source-relative src directory.",
      "The exact supervisor path, backend, output directory and all remaining arguments survive dispatch, including a repository path and argument containing spaces.",
      "The output directory exists before dispatch. Downstream exit 17 is returned unchanged.",
      "Malformed environment input exits 2 and missing backend exits 1, both without dispatch or the sweep output directory."
    ],
    "original_launcher": {
      "git_blob": "088f12d38aeb2fa60a7e863143373c65786f3137",
