    },
    "ranking_eligible": false,
    "remaining": [
      "Actual supervisor behavior, live credentials and model execution are outside this witness.",
      "These named clean properties do not establish that arbitrary inputs or the whole change are defect-free.",
      "No natural reviewer output is scored on this case; broader scorer and ranking validity remain open."
    ],
